{"agency_received_date":"2019-03-07","city_text":"Memphis","company_text":"ShopKo","effective_date":"2019-04-12","hold_reason":"unreviewed_rapid_response_row","kind":"notice","raw":{"# Affected":15,"# of Meetings":1,"Address":"459 Grand Ave","Closing Code":"MO201800075","Comments":"Shopko Hometown has been experiencing challenges in the retail industry, which has led to their decision to close the Memphis store on 4/12/19. 15 employees, skilled in retail sales and management are anticipated to be affected. The store is a general merchandise store typically located in smaller communities in the Midwest. At the company’s request an ETT meeting will be held on March 17th, 2019, which will provide information about employment services, training options and unemployment insurance benefits.

