{"agency_received_date":"2019-05-30","city_text":"Cabool","company_text":"Dairy Farmers of America","effective_date":"2019-06-02","hold_reason":"unreviewed_rapid_response_row","kind":"notice","raw":{"# Affected":57,"# of Meetings":null,"Address":"950 Metrecal St.","Closing Code":null,"Comments":"Dairy Farmers of America in Cabool has been experiencing a shortage of cans needed in order to process their milk products, which has led to their decision for temporary layoff. 57 employees, skilled in food processing and packaging are anticipated to be affected. The company specializes in dairy products processing. Company claims this is a temporary lay-off until a can manufacturer supplier can be engaged to meet production demands.

